-### The Power Method
+### The power method
 
 The power method computes $\psi^*$ by repeatedly applying $\psi \leftarrow \psi P$ until convergence.
 
 ```{code-cell} ipython3
-class StationarySolver:
-    """Solver for stationary distributions using the power method."""
-    
-    def __init__(self, P, tol=1e-10, max_iter=10_000):
